# UI standards (Modern SaaS Admin)

## Typography — Inter
- Page title: `.type-page-title` (32px / 2rem semibold)
- Section: `.type-section-title` (20px semibold)
- Table body: `.type-table` (14px medium) — default on `.table-row`
- Metadata: `.type-meta` (12px regular)

## Layout
- Sidebar: `--sidebar-width` (15rem), collapsed 4.5rem, collapsible
- Header: sticky, `.header-glass`; title via `usePageHeader()`; primary actions **inline** on desktop (not a second row unless `actionsToolbar: true`)
- Main: `.app-main` is `display: flex; flex-direction: column` (required for table pages)
- List pages: `<DataPageLayout metrics? filters? table={...} />` with `DataTableModule` + `TablePagination`
- Scroll pages: `<PageShell fill={false}>` (e.g. dashboard home)

## Spacing — 8px grid
`--space-1` (4px) … `--space-8` (32px). Default section gap: `--space-4`.

## Radius
- Cards / panels / tables: `--radius-card` (12px)
- Inputs / buttons: `--radius-control` (10px)

## Surfaces
- `.card`, `.card-elevated`, `.stat-card`, `.glass-panel`, `.filter-toolbar`, `.table-shell`
- Background: `--bg-subtle` (#F8FAFC) for app canvas
- Transitions: `.transition-ui` (200ms ease)

## Patterns
- Stats: `.stat-card` — equal min-height, hover lift, gradient fill
- Filters: `.filter-toolbar` + compact inputs; ghost reset via `.btn-ghost`
- Tables: sticky `.table-head`, zebra rows, row hover
- Sidebar nav active: left accent bar + subtle glow
- Do not mix arbitrary Tailwind radii; use tokens above

## Not yet global (add when building features)
- Dark mode, command palette wiring, skeleton loaders, bulk table selection
